.SH NAME
QAsyncIO \- Encapsulates I/O asynchronicity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qasyncio.h>\fR
.PP
Inherited by QDataSink and QDataSource.
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
